    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unfortunate accident, you find yourself facing an ominous bartender in a mysterious place. As all good bartenders do, he deeply understands your life and frustrations (perhaps too well), and makes you an offer you can't refuse.\u00a0How much would you gamble for a second chance at life in the face of certain death? Are you willing to risk everything, even your soul?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your limited items to increase your chance of survival. And maybe even sabotage your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/15743a26d523f76ecab5cb387d85c268.poster.avif?t=1753538469\" width=394 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/15743a26d523f76ecab5cb387d85c268.webm?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/15743a26d523f76ecab5cb387d85c268.mp4?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Poison</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a glass, and hope it isn't poisoned. You only have 3 lives, so make them count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/facd9f03a6c62c1c5cc179ce637ae20b.poster.avif?t=1753538469\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/facd9f03a6c62c1c5cc179ce637ae20b.webm?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/facd9f03a6c62c1c5cc179ce637ae20b.mp4?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Last Man Standing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns with the bartender until someone runs out of lives. Don't let it be you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/3fe32fdef57dbdfb1e5b0250c776ba22.poster.avif?t=1753538469\" width=800 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/3fe32fdef57dbdfb1e5b0250c776ba22.webm?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/3fe32fdef57dbdfb1e5b0250c776ba22.mp4?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Redeem Yourself in Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a down-on-your-luck character in Story Mode and help him avoid a terrible fate. And maybe even achieve something greater. 10-15 minutes of mystery with more questions than answers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unfortunate accident, you find yourself facing an ominous bartender in a mysterious place. As all good bartenders do, he deeply understands your life and frustrations (perhaps too well), and makes you an offer you can't refuse.\u00a0How much would you gamble for a second chance at life in the face of certain death? Are you willing to risk everything, even your soul?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your limited items to increase your chance of survival. And maybe even sabotage your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/15743a26d523f76ecab5cb387d85c268.poster.avif?t=1753538469\" width=394 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/15743a26d523f76ecab5cb387d85c268.webm?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/15743a26d523f76ecab5cb387d85c268.mp4?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Poison</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a glass, and hope it isn't poisoned. You only have 3 lives, so make them count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/facd9f03a6c62c1c5cc179ce637ae20b.poster.avif?t=1753538469\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/facd9f03a6c62c1c5cc179ce637ae20b.webm?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/facd9f03a6c62c1c5cc179ce637ae20b.mp4?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Last Man Standing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns with the bartender until someone runs out of lives. Don't let it be you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/3fe32fdef57dbdfb1e5b0250c776ba22.poster.avif?t=1753538469\" width=800 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/3fe32fdef57dbdfb1e5b0250c776ba22.webm?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575810/extras/3fe32fdef57dbdfb1e5b0250c776ba22.mp4?t=1753538469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Redeem Yourself in Story Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a down-on-your-luck character in Story Mode and help him avoid a terrible fate. And maybe even achieve something greater. 10-15 minutes of mystery with more questions than answers.</p>",
